body:
`getPerformerSceneTags` used `per_page: -1` to fetch all scenes in a single request, but Stash can silently truncate results beyond its server-side limit — causing tag suggestions to miss scenes for prolific performers.

## Changes

- **`plugins/performerTagger/performerTagger.js`** — Replace the single unbounded `findScenes` call with explicit pagination (100 scenes/page). Fetches first page to get `count`, then sequentially fetches remaining pages and concatenates results.

```js
// Before
filter: { per_page: -1 }

// After — paginated, 100 scenes at a time
const firstResult = await graphqlQuery(query, { performer_id: [performerId], filter: { per_page: PAGE_SIZE, page: 1 } });
const total = firstResult.findScenes.count || 0;
for (let page = 2; page <= Math.ceil(total / PAGE_SIZE); page++) { ... }
```
